<title>ZAIRE: African ministers arrive in Zaire for talks.</title>
<headline>African ministers arrive in Zaire for talks.</headline>
<dateline>KINSHASA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foreign ministers of South Africa, Kenya and Tanzania arrived in Zaire on Tuesday for talks on ending the conflict in Central Africa, foreign ministry officials said.</p>
<p>The foreign ministers of Cameroon and Zimbabwe were expected in Kinshasa later in the day along with Organisation of African Unity (OAU) Secretary-General Salim Ahmed Salim, the officials added.</p>
</text>
